{"unit_id":"AITabby__dockyard-dsh#card-zh","repo":"AITabby/dockyard-dsh","commit":"7246e1bab17bdbb691c277ea6a146778183df0ab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Dockyard DSH 面向 DSH Web，将 Codex、Antigravity、Grok、Claude、Cursor、WorkBuddy、Command Code、Hermes、OpenRouter Free、OpenCode 与 Kilo 接入共享 runtime，通过 LLM adapter 提供模型目录和请求。用户可用 /dockyard 命令及 composer 面板登录或导入账号、查看额度、设置账号策略和筛选模型。适合需要在 DSH 中集中管理多个模型提供方账号的用户；提供方使用各自授权、本地会话或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/runtime/src/dockyard-runtime.mjs:201-258","packages/dsh-plugin/src/index.mjs:56-60","packages/dsh-plugin/src/dockyard-service.mjs:679-690","packages/dsh-plugin/src/dockyard-remote-host.mjs:40-55"]}
